[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Everyone\'s talking about Seedance 2.5, but this new model is cheaper. It has less censorship, and it\'s completely open source. Not only that, but it\'s also incredibly good. Let\'s take a look at what it\'s capable of, how to use it,'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and try to push its censorship to its limits. Halo Mini Max 3 generates up to 15-second 2K videos with native audio, which means it allows us to generate room tone, sound effects, music, and'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'dialogue all at the same time. This model also takes in references of images, video and audio. Meaning we can apply some incredibly creative use cases to get complete control. Not only this,'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'but this model can be downloaded now from Hugging Face. And if you have an incredibly powerful computer, you can run it for free. But otherwise, if you need to run it on a platform or in the'

